ence we don't understand what's  happening is he trying to dialogue  secretly with vice president morillo and  while he's silent it feels as if  nicaragua's catholic church has been cut  off by the pope right now  so far the pope has not commented  upon seeing these images vice president  murillo repeated charges that some  priests are quote servants of the devil  and yankee invaders  neither she nor her husband the  president has offered any proof  lucia newman al jazeera
 

